      "description": "Alphabet and trailing-padding filter only. Supplemental validation MUST decode standard base64, re-encode byte-for-byte to the identical spelling (full quanta, exact padding, zero unused bits), and require 1..25162752 decoded bytes. Do not use a repeated four-character regex for large input.",
